From 4f1d933c85613bb921b8a295885ec136a9b0814a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakr233 <git@qaq.wiki>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:28:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 60/68] vgpu: zero-clear non-Clear secondary MRT slots and sync
 buffer-texture Stores

build_secondary_targets previously passed c.clear_color to the Vulkan pass even when loadAction was DontCare or an unrendered Load fallback, seeding RenderBox memoryless coverage/accumulator slots with QuartzCore's [1, 0, 0, 1] sentinel and tinting Liquid Glass backdrops and icon stacks red. Clear secondary slots to [0; 4] unless loadAction is Clear, matching primary color0, and keep buffer-backed GVA Stores synchronous so guest MTLBuffer and view readers observe rendered texels without texture-keyed synchronize commands.
---
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/mod.rs     |   8 ++
 .../src/runtime/draw/render_target.rs         |  10 ++
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/tests.rs   |   2 +
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/draw/vulkan.rs  | 120 +++++++++++++++++-
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/exec/mod.rs     |   1 +
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/exec/tests.rs   |   1 +
 6 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

